g3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">BOOK_LOW_AuntieEthelsRevenge_NoteMaskedCaptain</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_AuntieEthelsRevenge_NoteMaskedCaptain\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:BOOK_LOW_AuntieEthelsRevenge_NoteMaskedCaptain\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">3574bf1f-3843-464e-8149-546b83189a4b</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:3574bf1f-3843-464e-8149-546b83189a4b\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:3574bf1f-3843-464e-8149-546b83189a4b\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Carried by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Quenora_Grisly\" title=\"Quenora Grisly\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Quenora_Grisly.png/25px-Portrait_Quenora_Grisly.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Quenora_Grisly.png/38px-Portrait_Quenora_Grisly.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Quenora_Grisly.png/50px-Portrait_Quenora_Grisly.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Quenora Grisly\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/26/Portrait_Quenora_Grisly.png/25px-Portrait_Quenora_Grisly.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/26/Portrait_Quenora_Grisly.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Quenora_Grisly\" title=\"Quenora Grisly\">Quenora Grisly</a> in <a href=\"/wiki/The_Blushing_Mermaid#Involvement\" title=\"The Blushing Mermaid\">The Blushing Mermaid basement</a> if she is wearing a <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-common\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Whispering_Mask\" title=\"Whispering Mask\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d5/Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png/40px-Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d5/Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png/20px-Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d5/Whispering_Mask_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Whispering_Mask\" title=\"Whispering Mask\">hag mask</a></li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>My dear sweet Captain Grisly. \n</p><p><br>\nI've heard stories about you - and what tales they were! Of mighty battles and magnificent sea monsters. There's a woman who'll never be caught with her knickers down - or so I thought. \n</p><p><br>\nImagine my surprise when I nabbed your precious <a href=\"/wiki/Bosun_Gannet\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Bosun Gannet\">Bosun Gannet</a> from under your nose - and so easily! He's quite the resilient little bugger - hasn't said a peep about you!\n</p><p><br>\nBut he'll break - they always do.\n</p><p><br>\nMeet me in the Blushing Mermaid's basement - and come alone.\n</p><p><br>\nLots of love, Auntie.\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715015948\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.066 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.070 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2458/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 37790/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 10945/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.017/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1095354/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   56.803      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   56.803      1 -total\n 55.79%   31.690      9 Template:Icon_text\n 51.54%   29.277     27 Template:Trim\n 28.32%   16.085      1 Template:PageSeo\n 28.19%   16.015      2 Template:Hidden_code\n 25.45%   14.458      3 Template:CharLink\n 24.38%   13.847      4 Template:Icon_link\n 19.22%   10.917     11 Template:Ifempty\n 17.70%   10.055      2 Template:Uid\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:46981-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715015948 and revision id 372454. Rendering was triggered because: unknown\n -->\n</div>"}